# 真实客户资料、需求、日志、收件箱不进仓库（D9）。
# 仍跟踪：customers/示例-*/、下面四个目录里的 .gitkeep、02-projects/_example-project/

/customers/*
!/customers/.gitkeep
!/customers/示例-*/
!/customers/示例-*/**

/requirements/*
!/requirements/.gitkeep

/journal/*
!/journal/.gitkeep

/00-inbox/*
!/00-inbox/.gitkeep

# 私有飞书表结构。KB_DIR 指向仓库根时就是这个路径。
# 虚构示例仍跟踪：workbench/config/feishu-table.example.json
/config/feishu-table.json
/workbench/config/feishu-table.json
